  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know it sounds like a step backwards after quest, but hey, part of VRchat's appeal is desktop mode, which drives people to get VR hardware to get the \"complete\" whole experience.  If the go/gearVR can play the game, there's almost no reason not to release a flat build for android phones and tablets too with good enough gpu hardware, (which, let's be honest, is a lot of devices). \nYou could probably port to daydream/cardboard that way too, and by extension the Vive Focus and Lenovo Daydream.",
